{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yclept</strong> \u2013 a grim adventure where a king is destroying his own city, and you must stop him. To survive, you must navigate the game board, hunt down and eliminate his accomplices, and frame others to draw the king's wrath away from yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, someone is guaranteed to die. Do your best to ensure it isn't you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.poster.avif?t=1762078763\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.webm?t=1762078763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.mp4?t=1762078763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. The game unfolds simultaneously in both 3D and 2D realms. Gather resources and interact with inhabitants in the 2D world to influence the events in the 3D one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Your character is weak and heavily reliant on the people around you. You'll have to adapt when the king kills the most useful citizens at the most inopportune time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. You will have to sacrifice others to stay alive. There is no other way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086340?t=1762078763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086340?t=1762078763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/5dd55893b1d463f1b61140949e4beace0dc59955/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762078763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/5dd55893b1d463f1b61140949e4beace0dc59955/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762078763","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Images of blood and dead bodies"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yclept</strong> \u2013 a grim adventure where a king is destroying his own city, and you must stop him. To survive, you must navigate the game board, hunt down and eliminate his accomplices, and frame others to draw the king's wrath away from yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, someone is guaranteed to die. Do your best to ensure it isn't you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.poster.avif?t=1762078763\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.webm?t=1762078763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086340/extras/5e15f3e29ca72becf788171277f99362.mp4?t=1762078763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. The game unfolds simultaneously in both 3D and 2D realms. Gather resources and interact with inhabitants in the 2D world to influence the events in the 3D one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Your character is weak and heavily reliant on the people around you. You'll have to adapt when the king kills the most useful citizens at the most inopportune time.</p><p cla